---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /zh/
locale: zh
title: 首页
description: 浏览并下载《深入 180 日》。
alternate_url: /
---
<section class="page-hero wrap wide">
  <p class="eyebrow">从根基通往 2026 年研究前沿</p>
  <h1>{{ book.zh.title }}</h1>
  <p class="sub">作者：{{ book.zh.authors }} · 翻译：{{ book.zh.translators }}</p>
</section>

<section class="wrap wide">
  <div class="download-grid home-actions">
    <article class="download-card" data-reading-card data-reading-locale="zh" data-reading-continue-kicker="继续上次阅读">
      <p class="card-kicker" data-reading-kicker>在线阅读</p>
      <h2><a href="/zh/days/001-what-is-knowledge/" data-reading-link>从第 1 日开始</a></h2>
      <p data-reading-summary>从最初的理由出发，深入数学、物理、生命、心智、智能、文明与前沿。</p>
    </article>
    <script type="application/json" data-reading-days data-reading-locale="zh">[
      {% for item in collections.zhDays %}
      {
        "day": {{ item.data.day | json | safe }},
        "url": {{ item.url | json | safe }},
        "label": {{ ("第" + (item.data.day | padDay) + "日 · " + item.data.title) | json | safe }},
        "title": {{ item.data.title | json | safe }},
        "summary": {{ item.data.summary | json | safe }}
      }{{ "," if not loop.last }}
      {% endfor %}
    ]</script>
    <div class="download-stack">
      <article class="download-card">
        <p class="card-kicker">离线版</p>
        <h2><a href="{{ book.zh.downloads.epub }}">下载 EPUB</a></h2>
      </article>
      <article class="download-card">
        <p class="card-kicker">印刷版</p>
        <h2><a href="{{ book.zh.downloads.pdf }}">下载 PDF</a></h2>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap wide">
  <p class="sec-eyebrow">最新章节</p>
  <div class="toc-grid">
    {% for item in collections.zhDays | latestDays(10) %}
      {% include "components/day-card.njk" %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <p class="all-days-link"><a href="/zh/syllabus/">查看完整课程表</a></p>
</section>
